    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10327" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντιπέρ-ᾱν</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντιπέρ-ην</span></b> , Adv.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντιπέρᾱς</span>
			, v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				6.2.9
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				2.177
			</span></i>,al.; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατ᾽ ἀντιπέραν,</span>
			c. gen., <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				9.41.11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Adj., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀσίδα τ᾽ ἀντιπέρην
			τε</span> Asia and <i>the opposite coast,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Mosch.
				2.9
			</span></i>.</div>
